# Node: atomic.ByDefinition.BuiltinProp.Bijective
# Run: litex -f examples/proof_nodes/atomic/by_definition/builtin_bijective.lit
#
# Obligations: $injective and $surjective on the same triple.
# Same singleton identity setup as the injective / surjective tracers.

have fn id1(x {1}) {1} = x
exist x {1} st {x = 1}
by def $bijective({1}, {1}, id1)
